    },
    {
      "id": "05d6e3fd61dd1ae53719d6d0d9b0cf87ba316cb099cd2f8ee988e99850666189",
      "text": "On this page",
      "hash": "b5658fc8edda24f9c94eabac9e536e0a18e3055a8ca255f9d1b8f256ea02a6cc"
    },
    {
      "id": "b75083e6e12512193d1048d85582e83b617823b16a41bb9b08a2e78d7e9fc9d2",
      "text": "Up next",
      "hash": "e31da5b25f8b7324861e9aadaf5c503e7fd43e739fa3be17ebe63e999fb13df1"
    },
    {
      "id": "08c5a47b2c3ef2db982eb525acb75142c66d9eb0d08ca52d12e776b9a94b71f2",
      "text": "Scrollycoding",
      "hash": "a92db14e4d481e7975b3459710fbf8ec73dcc232e366b057507f7e2891b1d6da"
    },
    {
      "id": "e9583188d262f5927c6e44205eda75657c39363e17c4758f35a297cedb3319f4",
      "text": "In our",
      "hash": "6afb07fd0b1b26d299060a2f19ab0a372f02e0f6ab0d10aca5ea5ed53b562e67"
    },
    {
      "id": "279074dceb2a1ccec3510b0de1a4be7fc7898082aa16a429b658a3de6cddbb47",
      "text": "previous example",
      "hash": "20fd82f3a5ea79d10e936dc73cd5bc7e46ee7f862e1978036f572f8f936aab64"
    },
    {
      "id": "37a750d84e747bf5074f63e0aeac653f0ee92d178ae7f7ad92fd0bfdb0b2869b",
      "text": ", we saw how we can generate text with the AI SDK.",
      "hash": "ddd1b3b877afa84afac32366ef13653aa18d76cf127cc1a0e1b96dcfee1b003a"
    },
    {
      "id": "7423da4db64e59668830df60bc03f076da378b8e8464457c3a0bea41dca7c23c",
      "text": "But this spits out the text all at once at the end.",
      "hash": "490bc1d73c53293d3aca9b2253e487e5836797a189228e6dcc5b4a176f8abca7"
    },
    {
      "id": "a4445f2c147e90faf2578647038d6b5f77de40060b8e4ba81b644add07ab534e",
      "text": "What if we need to stream the text",
      "hash": "56fde13365bd9053ea62ef0bb137591e621ec1d12ca4d4c08a3cef71dc2eec00"
    },
    {
      "id": "6352f50f86c8108d1dac75ce3123026216655e9c5fa0c64c872c79d9f8700042",
      "text": "token by token?",
      "hash": "a73adfe3be2b2f9f0771ef37760d2d70545dd59e241004a1a376588504c5208b"
    },
    {
      "id": "f8aea02c01897b6d3084d3808b0cbfedf8987031ba182a833ed8795726dea04d",
      "text": "For that, we can",
      "hash": "c287dfee769af2377de6ade1afcc73fd4228301eb019a06e6ad9be000547c9e6"
    },
    {
      "id": "81aef4fff058d1e38e33130464bdea86f78bc523ef9ab9928442da6f528af371",
      "text": "use the",
      "hash": "dca28edae45dd2aa71639e6ff713ff5271c22ca905dc52e50c1b334bb2c9b2ae"
    },
    {
      "id": "caa1b27d59369a7274aed8183cd08679f877321bb175ecdd1e1eb8f0f40da717",
      "text": "from the AI SDK.",
      "hash": "30c18eeab939ed878fac725ed07f4cc333b52f748cf41c2ef25cc368f7e6771a"
    },
    {
      "id": "b1ae46289a7ba856bace04e8f4cc3973b9ba75f4f0d48750dd45f9f8deb43fc7",
      "text": "This takes in a model and a prompt in exactly the same way, but instead of just returning text, it returns a",
      "hash": "e4d85042e80fe51e98a6937cfb0319a03b082d693ae4651cf438cfb6bb6a55ff"
    },
    {
      "id": "e4371875c98218a5d7249268348988d78c174e226fec0fdada8b22cc6904fefd",
      "text": "The",
      "hash": "b344d80e24a3679999fa964450b34bc24d1578a35509f934c1418b0a20d21a67"
    },
    {
      "id": "d723dd56f149034b1e976b43e6533f82255f332ddddb12062d6565cbe2d84d1b",
      "text": "is an async iterable. That means it can be streamed to a file or over a network connection.",
      "hash": "dab21f7662a19b6886b242d6e0ac37e4c73a0edf9f4e340a69f0ca7910850199"
    },
    {
      "id": "40daf0eba846fbf5abcfbc37f9e7541cf3617b37ad0d630ef85df2722b467515",
      "text": "In this example, we're just going to stream it to",
      "hash": "7eae2591c04b593e817262a3752cbdf492c583f824c63971deb013c0410819af"
    },
    {
      "id": "095595ddded01160670431fa5d1fb7c21114e0382123ef25a8577c9a0d593b6f",
      "text": "This",
      "hash": "86e1de74820a9b252ba33b2eed445b0cd02c445b5f4b8007205aff1762d7301a"
    },
    {
      "id": "c4ce7240fa2705cd3f5c8e450f48b492d6dd04513e307ef94880446febc423f9",
      "text": "loop waits for every chunk of the",
      "hash": "09219ceb89b24b21fa009838d55cbd048194246fc3192008fc216f6e826259ca"
    },
    {
      "id": "f43e6c30124cad4bef6a61ae414eecf64f911a0c0d88d6d977001700d7a2f63c",
      "text": "and then writes that chunk to",
      "hash": "dfc7c3f97f366e45cabe9861e854a770eb265de5fdb42b76e8ec5393568c2db5"
    },
    {
      "id": "f4e7a544e5a9cf85cd710a638b20ffd9e160c19cf24d94e0e114e61594ccc231",
      "text": "Let's say we ask it \"what is the color of the sun?\".",
      "hash": "bf075f2951790d6ca19607b0d1ccc8d7c567c3a4bbf777f7d43f757246637b92"
    },
    {
      "id": "b656181680c5b20e2527b929abe8e27054647d7479cec68ea3d9e81957ab5a4e",
      "text": "If we now run this code, we're going to see it streaming to our console.",
      "hash": "15aa40135fafb3b1f99727ccf4999536c8926e69b8e8713062c6692729edf324"
    },
    {
      "id": "776143adaef7c1529400b7e871916e43b076d409cba583f416250de4b41e7942",
      "text": "And from here it's pretty easy to imagine hooking this up to a network request and then just streaming this to a UI.",
      "hash": "934a57cfac5c42ecddd00af0e71a11b1c8a2133553daafd7540ea6e48c972eab"
    },
    {
      "id": "dc794a6fad9d540e4dd2f79a5be70d03cece446a61f694b31f07dbbf41cea6e7",
      "text": "The stream text function also returns a",
      "hash": "c7e34f057fd1de7ad35ecaa7698fd4d349ab4a7c0b3ceaef9846afb2fc00567a"
    },
    {
      "id": "9f760fae0345d2c263c907ed00fe75e7b3cf68d8d4325c5562fcab4b19b098c7",
      "text": "This means if you just want to wait for the full text anyway, you can just await the promise.",
      "hash": "e9f2eb2de268599da5f88861fd1891aaa04041136cd7b5e7a799f68c7e175030"
    },
    {
      "id": "4c3908f5fe4371b0cd7100f17bb289c62d8da8cb4c3945e3419c0ffea1d02db4",
      "text": "Share on X",
      "hash": "78d21bbf6b047944ec42890d28e151c61dbab35213fc65cc7be70c0c19c24407"
    },
    {
      "id": "adee1433acb612f356d8ef5f38d6f7d9d74467d59232c0c4f3a708149d106cff",
      "text": "Share on Bluesky",
      "hash": "08863b88a05c60410c38c4caec5bc72535b0f01793ce6cee9171b6358b2c11da"
    },
    {
      "id": "20b23b6251efa904e535e97872d1c87643c4e29e9bd8787ae3962cf33996e3ac",
      "text": "Share on LinkedIn",
      "hash": "ab87c050148bd1d372e3ec3483a606127a7a1faec0f1ca5543bc3465d84fe6c9"
    },
    {
      "id": "cdfe7d0b2f6e6659d9e45e0b43b6acb9aacda1268f23a52c7e275f59de09e1c0",
      "text": "Copy URL",
      "hash": "b26d1037f1c2da31a0296d915982f12049f91bfedb998b105ce967b73a796699"
    },
    {
      "id": "7861abb9f406dba851c5429e79c38c45eb7eded20fbfb299f44868be05e5cc94",
      "text": "Previous",
      "hash": "a57b08a480b822a0a572b993391c292ede593bf8000b406675b180bbb16260fa"
